<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/_head', { title: '首頁' }) %>
    <style>
        h1 { text-align: center; font-size: 2.5em; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        h2 { text-align: left; }

        .subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            color: var(--text-color);
        }

        .section { margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .section h2 {
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-color);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 1.8em;
        }

        ol {
            list-style: none;
            padding-left: 0;
            counter-reset: step-counter;
        }
        ol li {
            counter-increment: step-counter;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 1.1em;
        }
        ol li::before {
            content: counter(step-counter);
            margin-right: 15px;
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .cta-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 16px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        /* Featured animal card */
        .featured-section { margin-top: 40px; }
        .featured-section h2 {
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-color);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 1.8em;
        }
        .featured-card {
            display: flex;
            gap: 24px;
            align-items: flex-start;
            background: #f9f7f4;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease;
        }
        .featured-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 20px var(--shadow-color); }
        .featured-img {
            width: 160px;
            height: 160px;
            object-fit: cover;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            display: block;
        }
        .featured-body { padding: 20px 20px 20px 0; flex: 1; }
        .featured-body h3 { color: var(--heading-color); margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 1.3em; }
        .featured-body p { margin: 4px 0; font-size: 0.95em; }
        .featured-body strong { color: var(--heading-color); }
        .featured-shelter {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            background-color: rgba(129, 166, 211, 0.15);
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.82em;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .featured-loading { padding: 24px; color: #aaa; font-style: italic; }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .featured-card { flex-direction: column; }
            .featured-img { width: 100%; height: 200px; }
            .featured-body { padding: 16px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/_header') %>
    <div id="toast" class="toast"></div>

    <div class="container--card">
        <h1>🐾 FurFriend Finder 🐾</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">一個致力於幫助走失毛孩找到回家的路的平台。</p>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>我們的理念</h2>
            <p>我們相信，透過科技的力量，可以更有效率地整合協尋資訊，提高毛孩回家的機會。每一個生命都值得被珍惜，每一次團圓都是我們的動力。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>使用方法</h2>
            <ol>
                <li>點擊下方的「協尋登記」，填寫您走失寵物的詳細資料。</li>
                <li>我們的系統將會開始比對全台收容所的公開資料。</li>
                <li>一旦發現高度相似的毛孩，我們會立即透過 Email 通知您。</li>
                <li>您也可以隨時在「個人資料頁」查看您的案件狀態。</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="cta-container">
            <a href="/report-lost" class="btn btn-primary btn-pill">開始協尋登記</a>
            <a href="/quick-use"   class="btn btn-primary btn-pill">快速使用</a>
        </div>

        <div class="featured-section">
            <h2>今日推薦動物</h2>
            <div id="featured-animal" class="featured-card">
                <p class="featured-loading">載入中...</p>
            </div>
            <p style="text-align:right; margin-top:10px; font-size:0.9em">
                <a href="/shelter-animals" style="color:var(--primary-color);font-weight:bold">
                    查看更多收容所動物 →
                </a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
    async function loadFeatured() {
        const container = document.getElementById('featured-animal');
        try {
            const res = await fetch('/api/animals/random');
            if (!res.ok) throw new Error();
            const { extras } = await res.json();
            const a = extras.animal;
            if (!a) {
                container.innerHTML = '<p class="featured-loading">目前沒有可顯示的動物。</p>';
                return;
            }
            const imgSrc = a.picture || 'https://placehold.co/320x320/f4efe8/a77b5a?text=%F0%9F%90%BE';
            container.innerHTML = `
                <img class="featured-img" src="${imgSrc}" alt="${a.variety || '動物'}">
                <div class="featured-body">
                    <h3>${a.variety || '未知品種'}</h3>
                    <p><strong>物種:</strong> ${a.kind || '—'}</p>
                    <p><strong>性別:</strong> ${sexLabel(a.sex)}</p>
                    <p><strong>毛色:</strong> ${a.colour || '—'}</p>
                    ${a.shelter_name ? `<span class="featured-shelter">📍 ${a.shelter_name}</span>` : ''}
                </div>`;
        } catch {
            container.innerHTML = '<p class="featured-loading">無法載入動物資料。</p>';
        }
    }

    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
        loadFeatured();
        setInterval(loadFeatured, 10000); // rotate every 10s
    });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
